<title>USA: Loews buys back 2.8 mln shrs in 9 mos 1996.</title>
<headline>Loews buys back 2.8 mln shrs in 9 mos 1996.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loews Corp said Wednesday that it repurchased 2,832,800 shares of its outstanding common stock during the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>The company said that depending on market conditions, it would continue to purchase its outstanding common stock &quot;in the open market or otherwise.&quot;</p>
<p>The company had about 115.2 million outstanding shares when it reported third quarter results today. Earnings were $3.37 per share, compared to $3.28 for the 1995 third quarter and $2.30 estimated by First Call.  </p>
<p>Loews shares were trading at 83-7/8 Wednesday noon, up from Tuesday's 82-3/8 close.</p>
